    sffi_authority_baseline_stale_after_gpu_bootstrap_2026-08-24, 3, "2026-11-09 p3-subj6: FIXED. Root cause measured: snapshot commit 4edef8fab8e (GPU/bootstrap sync) regressed scripts/audit/sffi-call-authority-census.shs to a pre-2026-08-24 variant (lost prose masking, wildcard sffi-import inventory, multiline-signature body scanning) and deleted baselines/sffi-call-authority-v1.tsv while the selftest kept the mature contract. Restored scanner+selftest+baseline from 4edef8fab8e^. Executed: selftest PASS (was cp-stat ERROR); full census PASS missing=15489 vs ratchet 19412, baseline not increased; differing rows identified and reviewed (54 regressed-only prose/header artifacts, 625 mature-only wildcard call sites, top: host_vulkan_lavapipe_provider.spl 66, nogc_async_mut/cuda/mod.spl 62, _Tls13/handshake.spl 52). Explains the 19503-vs-19504 delta as scanner-identity drift across the sync, not a new call site. Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/sffi_authority_baseline_stale_after_gpu_bootstrap_2026-08-24.md Resolution 2026-11-09"

